        }
      }
    },
    "A man who fears pain more than failure will taste both" : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer den Schmerz mehr fürchtet als das Scheitern, wird beides kosten"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El hombre que le teme más al dolor que al fracaso probará los dos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A person who never made a mistake never tried anything new." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer nie einen Fehler gemacht hat, hat nie etwas Neues ausprobiert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Una persona que nunca ha cometido un error nunca ha intentado nada nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ship in the harbour is safe, but that’s not what it was made for." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ein Schiff im Hafen ist sicher, aber dafür wurde es nicht gebaut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un barco en el puerto está seguro, pero no fue construido para eso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above all, be the heroine of your life, not the victim." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sei vor allem der Held deines Lebens, nicht das Opfer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sobre todo, sé el protagonista de tu vida, no la víctima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accept responsibility for your life. Know that it is you who will get you where you want to go, no one else." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Übernimm Verantwortung für dein Leben. Du selbst bringst dich dahin, wo du hinwillst – niemand sonst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Acepta la responsabilidad de tu vida. Debes saber que eres tú quien te llevará adonde quieres ir, nadie más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
