    "Back on the market after a breakup or divorce" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nach einer Trennung oder Scheidung wieder auf dem Markt"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "De vuelta en la soltería tras una ruptura o un divorcio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Be not afraid of growing slowly; be afraid only of standing still." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Fürchte nicht, langsam zu wachsen. Fürchte nur, stillzustehen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No temas crecer lentamente; teme solo quedarte quieto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beliefs & Reframes" : {
      "comment" : "Course title.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Überzeugungen & neue Perspektiven"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Creencias y nuevas perspectivas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Believe that what you do makes a difference because it does." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Glaub daran, dass dein Handeln etwas bewirkt – denn das tut es."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cree que lo que haces marca la diferencia, porque la marca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Believe you can and you're halfway there." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Glaub, dass du es kannst, und du hast schon die Hälfte geschafft."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cree que puedes y ya estás a mitad de camino."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Better mindset & confidence" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Besseres Mindset & mehr Selbstvertrauen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mejor mentalidad y más seguridad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brave men may not live forever, but cautious men do not live at all." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mutige Männer leben vielleicht nicht ewig, aber vorsichtige leben überhaupt nicht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los valientes quizá no vivan para siempre, pero los cautelosos no viven en absoluto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change equals self-improvement. Push yourself to places you haven’t been before." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Veränderung heißt, an sich zu arbeiten. Geh an Orte, an denen du noch nie warst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cambiar es mejorar. Llévate a lugares donde nunca has estado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change is hard at first, messy in the middle, and gorgeous at the end." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Veränderung ist am Anfang schwer, in der Mitte chaotisch und am Ende wunderschön."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El cambio es difícil al principio, caótico a la mitad y maravilloso al final."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Closing" : {
