        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La felicidad depende de nosotros mismos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Happiness is not something ready made. It comes from your own actions." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Glück gibt es nicht fertig. Es entsteht aus deinem eigenen Handeln."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La felicidad no es algo hecho. Viene de tus propias acciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "He who is not courageous enough to take risks will accomplish nothing in life." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer nicht mutig genug ist, Risiken einzugehen, wird im Leben nichts erreichen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Quien no es lo bastante valiente para arriesgarse no logrará nada en la vida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I freeze up around women I find attractive" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bei Frauen, die ich attraktiv finde, erstarre ich"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Me congelo con las mujeres que me atraen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If nothing ever changed, there’d be no butterflies." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn sich nie etwas ändern würde, gäbe es keine Schmetterlinge."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si nada cambiara, no existirían las mariposas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If there is no struggle, there is no progress." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ohne Kampf kein Fortschritt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si no hay lucha, no hay progreso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you are not willing to risk the unusual, you will have to settle for the ordinary." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer das Ungewöhnliche nicht wagt, muss sich mit dem Gewöhnlichen zufriedengeben."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si no estás dispuesto a arriesgarte a lo inusual, tendrás que conformarte con lo ordinario."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don't try, you'll never know what could of been." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du es nicht versuchst, wirst du nie wissen, was hätte sein können."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si no lo intentas, nunca sabrás lo que pudo haber sido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don’t like something, change it. If you can’t change it, change your attitude." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn dir etwas nicht gefällt, ändere es. Wenn du es nicht ändern kannst, ändere deine Einstellung."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si no te gusta algo, cámbialo. Si no puedes cambiarlo, cambia tu actitud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don’t risk anything, you risk everything." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer nichts riskiert, riskiert alles."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si no arriesgas nada, lo arriesgas todo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don’t swing you’ll never hit a home run." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer nicht schießt, kann kein Tor schießen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El que no patea al arco, no mete gol."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you face towards the sunshine, you’ll notice the shadows will fall behind you." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du dich der Sonne zuwendest, fallen die Schatten hinter dich."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si miras hacia el sol, verás que las sombras quedan detrás de ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you wait to feel ready, you will wait forever." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn du wartest, bis du dich bereit fühlst, wartest du ewig."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si esperas sentirte listo, esperarás para siempre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In order to succeed, your desire for success should be greater than your fear of failure." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Um erfolgreich zu sein, muss dein Wunsch nach Erfolg größer sein als deine Angst vor dem Scheitern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Para triunfar, tus ganas de tener éxito deben ser más grandes que tu miedo a fracasar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inaction guarantees nothing happens. Action is the only path that creates possibility." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nichtstun garantiert, dass nichts passiert. Nur Handeln schafft Möglichkeiten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Quedarte quieto garantiza que no pase nada. Actuar es el único camino que crea posibilidades."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inner Stability" : {
      "comment" : "Course title.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Innere Stabilität"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Estabilidad interior"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Integration & Mastery" : {
      "comment" : "Course category name: a Courses tab filter chip and section header, a Home carousel card, and the category part of the Home 'continue' card. Analytics keeps the English name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Alltag & Meisterschaft"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Día a día y maestría"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It always seems impossible until it’s done." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es scheint immer unmöglich, bis es getan ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Siempre parece imposible hasta que se hace."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It does not matter how slowly you go as long as you do not stop." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es ist egal, wie langsam du gehst, solange du nicht stehen bleibst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No importa lo lento que vayas, siempre y cuando no te detengas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is necessary to put yourself out for rejection and accept that you will be rejected." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Man muss sich der Zurückweisung aussetzen und akzeptieren, dass man zurückgewiesen wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es necesario exponerte al rechazo y aceptar que te van a rechazar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's not because things are difficult that we dare not venture. It's because we dare not venture that they are difficult." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nicht weil es schwer ist, wagen wir es nicht, sondern weil wir es nicht wagen, ist es schwer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No es porque las cosas sean difíciles que no nos atrevemos; es porque no nos atrevemos que son difíciles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s better to know and be disappointed than to never know and always wonder." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lieber wissen und enttäuscht sein, als nie wissen und sich immer fragen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es mejor saber y decepcionarte que nunca saber y siempre preguntártelo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping conversations going" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Gespräche am Laufen halten"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mantener la conversación"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leap before you're ready; growth happens in mid-air." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
