          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Our greatest glory is not in never falling, but in rising every time we fall." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Unser größter Ruhm liegt nicht darin, nie zu fallen, sondern jedes Mal wieder aufzustehen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Nuestra mayor gloria no está en no caer nunca, sino en levantarnos cada vez que caemos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Patience, persistence and perspiration make an unbeatable combination for success." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
