    "The best way to predict the future is to create it." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der beste Weg, die Zukunft vorherzusagen, ist, sie zu gestalten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La mejor manera de predecir el futuro es crearlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The biggest risk is not taking any risk." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Das größte Risiko ist, kein Risiko einzugehen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El mayor riesgo es no arriesgarse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cave you fear to enter holds the treasure you seek." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Höhle, die du zu betreten fürchtest, birgt den Schatz, den du suchst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La cueva a la que temes entrar guarda el tesoro que buscas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The door stays closed until you turn the handle. She can’t say yes to the version of you that never shows up." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Tür bleibt zu, bis du die Klinke drückst. Sie kann nicht Ja sagen zu der Version von dir, die nie auftaucht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La puerta sigue cerrada hasta que giras la manija. Ella no puede decirle que sí a la versión de ti que nunca aparece."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game doesn't start until you step on the field." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Das Spiel beginnt erst, wenn du den Platz betrittst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El partido no empieza hasta que pisas la cancha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The greatest glory in living lies not in never falling, but in rising every time we fall." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der größte Ruhm im Leben liegt nicht darin, nie zu fallen, sondern jedes Mal wieder aufzustehen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La mayor gloria de vivir no está en no caer nunca, sino en levantarnos cada vez que caemos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The guy who is awkward still beats the guy who never acts." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der Typ, der unbeholfen ist, schlägt immer noch den, der nie etwas tut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El que es torpe le gana igual al que nunca actúa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The journey of a thousand miles begins with one step." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Auch eine Reise von tausend Meilen beginnt mit einem Schritt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un viaje de mil millas comienza con un solo paso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The man who moves a mountain begins by carrying away small stones." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer einen Berg versetzen will, fängt damit an, kleine Steine wegzutragen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El hombre que mueve una montaña empieza cargando piedras pequeñas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The man you want to be is built one decision at a time." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der Mann, der du sein willst, entsteht Entscheidung für Entscheidung."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El hombre que quieres ser se construye decisión tras decisión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The master has failed more times than the beginner has even tried." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der Meister ist öfter gescheitert, als der Anfänger es überhaupt versucht hat."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El maestro ha fallado más veces de las que el principiante lo ha intentado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most certain way to succeed is always to try just one more time." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der sicherste Weg zum Erfolg ist, es immer noch ein weiteres Mal zu versuchen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La forma más segura de triunfar es intentarlo siempre una vez más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only bad approach is the one you didn't make." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Das einzige schlechte Ansprechen ist das, das du nicht gewagt hast."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El único mal acercamiento es el que no hiciste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only failure is the one where you stop trying." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Das einzige Scheitern ist, wenn du aufhörst, es zu versuchen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El único fracaso es dejar de intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only impossible journey is the one you never begin." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die einzige unmögliche Reise ist die, die du nie beginnst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El único viaje imposible es el que nunca empiezas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only limit to our realization of tomorrow will be our doubts of today." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die einzige Grenze für unser Morgen sind unsere Zweifel von heute."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El único límite para lograr nuestro mañana serán nuestras dudas de hoy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only place where success comes before work is in the dictionary." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der einzige Ort, an dem Erfolg vor Arbeit kommt, ist das Wörterbuch."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El único lugar donde el éxito viene antes que el trabajo es el diccionario."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secret of getting ahead is getting started." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Das Geheimnis des Vorankommens ist, anzufangen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El secreto para salir adelante es empezar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The successful warrior is the average man, with laser-like focus." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Der erfolgreiche Krieger ist ein ganz normaler Mann mit messerscharfem Fokus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El guerrero exitoso es un hombre común con un enfoque como un láser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is only one way to avoid criticism: do nothing, say nothing, and be nothing." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es gibt nur einen Weg, Kritik zu vermeiden: nichts tun, nichts sagen und nichts sein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Solo hay una forma de evitar la crítica: no hacer nada, no decir nada y no ser nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There will be times when you succeed and there will be times when you fail, and both are equally important." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Es wird Zeiten geben, in denen du Erfolg hast, und Zeiten, in denen du scheiterst – und beide sind gleich wichtig."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Habrá veces en que triunfes y veces en que fracases, y las dos son igual de importantes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tired of being on my own" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Keine Lust mehr, allein zu sein"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cansado de estar solo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trust yourself. You are capable of much more than you think." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Vertrau dir selbst. Du kannst viel mehr, als du denkst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Confía en ti. Eres capaz de mucho más de lo que crees."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upgrading Your Lifestyle" : {
      "comment" : "Course title.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Dein Lifestyle-Upgrade"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mejora tu estilo de vida"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Want more confidence in general" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Allgemein mehr Selbstvertrauen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Quiero más seguridad en general"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We don't grow when things are easy. We grow when we face challenges." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wir wachsen nicht, wenn es leicht ist. Wir wachsen, wenn wir uns Herausforderungen stellen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No crecemos cuando las cosas son fáciles. Crecemos cuando enfrentamos retos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We may encounter many defeats but we must not be defeated." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wir mögen viele Niederlagen erleben, aber wir dürfen uns nicht besiegen lassen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Puede que suframos muchas derrotas, pero no debemos ser derrotados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you’re not changing, you’re choosing." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Was du nicht änderst, wählst du."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lo que no estás cambiando, lo estás eligiendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whatever the mind of man can conceive and believe, it can achieve." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Was der menschliche Geist sich vorstellen und glauben kann, kann er auch erreichen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Todo lo que la mente humana puede concebir y creer, lo puede lograr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it feels scary to jump, that is exactly when you jump." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wenn sich der Sprung beängstigend anfühlt, genau dann springst du."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cuando saltar te da miedo, ese es justo el momento de saltar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether you think you can or think you can't, you are right." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ob du denkst, du kannst es, oder du kannst es nicht – du hast recht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tanto si crees que puedes como si crees que no, tienes razón."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within the past month" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Im letzten Monat"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En el último mes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within the past week" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "In der letzten Woche"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En la última semana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worrying about coming across wrong" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding answer option.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Die Sorge, falsch rüberzukommen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Me preocupa dar una mala impresión"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can be the ripest, juiciest peach in the world, and there's still going to be somebody who hates peaches." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Du kannst der reifste, saftigste Pfirsich der Welt sein, und trotzdem wird es jemanden geben, der Pfirsiche hasst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Puedes ser el durazno más maduro y jugoso del mundo y aun así habrá alguien a quien no le gusten los duraznos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can choose courage, or you can choose comfort, but you cannot choose both." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Du kannst Mut wählen oder Bequemlichkeit, aber nicht beides."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Puedes elegir el valor o puedes elegir la comodidad, pero no puedes elegir ambos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can waste your lives drawing lines. Or you can live your life crossing them." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Du kannst dein Leben damit verschwenden, Grenzen zu ziehen. Oder du lebst es, indem du sie überschreitest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Puedes desperdiciar tu vida trazando líneas o puedes vivirla cruzándolas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can, you should, and if you’re brave enough to start, you will." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Du kannst es, du solltest es, und wenn du mutig genug bist anzufangen, wirst du es."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Puedes, deberías y, si eres lo bastante valiente para empezar, lo harás."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You cannot change what you refuse to confront." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Was du nicht angehst, kannst du nicht ändern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No puedes cambiar lo que te niegas a enfrentar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You cannot swim for new horizons until you have the courage to lose sight of the shore." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Du kannst nicht zu neuen Horizonten schwimmen, solange du nicht den Mut hast, die Küste aus den Augen zu verlieren."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No puedes nadar hacia nuevos horizontes hasta que tengas el valor de perder de vista la orilla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You cannot win a game you never play." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ein Spiel, das du nie spielst, kannst du nicht gewinnen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No puedes ganar un partido que nunca juegas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can’t control peoples actions, but you can control your reaction to them." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Du kannst nicht kontrollieren, was andere tun, aber wie du darauf reagierst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No puedes controlar lo que hacen los demás, pero sí cómo reaccionas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can’t fall if you don’t climb. But there’s no joy in living your whole life on the ground." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Wer nicht klettert, kann nicht fallen. Aber es macht keine Freude, sein ganzes Leben am Boden zu verbringen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "No puedes caer si no subes. Pero no hay alegría en pasar toda la vida en el suelo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don’t have to be great to start, but you have to start to be great." : {
      "comment" : "Daily quote on the Home screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Du musst nicht großartig sein, um anzufangen, aber du musst anfangen, um großartig zu werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
